  "description": "Highlights for any .NET MAUI view: a moving rainbow rim while a model works (Edge), rings that say \"tap here\" (Pulse), a light sweep (Sheen), a point of light along the border (Trace) and a breathing halo (Breathe), spotlight tours over views, header actions and tabs, and a glow round the whole window that can follow a level. Native layers on each platform, once, a number of times, forever or until tapped, once per install with a key, still under Reduce Motion.",
